  "description": "Cha Sang-Do, the adopted son and heir apparent of the Sangbaek Group, attempts to renounce his claim to the succession and leave the organization after the chairman’s death, but Yang-Jin, an employee at the host bar he used to manage, comes to see him, saying he has feelings for him. Although Sang-Do suspects Yang-Jin of being a spy for the organization and constantly insults him, he gradually opens his heart to Yang-Jin, who steadfastly refuses to leave his side, and eventually learns the secret between them that Yang-Jin had been hiding...\n\n*“You haven’t changed a bit, Sang-Do.”* \n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
